Do not produce: purple/indigo/blue-violet gradients; glassmorphism or frosted blur cards; neon glows; blurred gradient orbs; centered-everything heroes with a gradient headline and two buttons; a pill badge above every headline; uniform grids of identical cards with icon-in-a-circle; `rounded-2xl` plus `shadow-xl` on everything; gray-on-gray low contrast; emoji or "✨" anywhere; fake dashboards with lorem; invented names and reviews; hype words ("unlock", "supercharge", "seamless", "revolutionize", "elevate", "game-changing").

Voice: plain, warm, specific to food and money. Short sentences. Real numbers. Examples: "₱5,000 · 4 mouths · 14 days." "Starts with your pesos, not your cravings." "Prices from your market, not a currency converter." "A shopping list that knows chicken comes in 500 g." "Don't feel like Thursday? Swap it, the budget holds." "Only dishes your kitchen can actually cook."

